    "cache": "disabled and isolated",
    "credential": "only OPENROUTER_API_KEY extracted in launcher memory; no dotenv or secret in arguments/artifacts",
    "pre_batch_admission": "fresh official catalog, exact endpoint and ZDR inventory; exact zero prompt/completion and binding zero request cap; stop on unknown price/status",
    "stop": "Stop on admission/privacy/budget error, terminal transport failure, or an unrecovered rate-limit response; retain every physical attempt and its error. An internally recovered transport or 429 retry within the hard physical-call ceiling is allowed by remaining-panel-criteria.md and is not a scientific error. Never selectively rerun a bad quality trial; after a terminal 429 pause this stage and work elsewhere until reset.",
    "drift": "commit amendment before changed input/code/config/rubric; rerun both sides if matching is lost",
    "usage": "Record every physical attempt and response/error. Require served-model and prompt/completion usage for every successful completion; retain failed attempts, zero-price request caps, fallback evidence and response cost if present. A static zero estimate is not a billing receipt.",
